  "content": {
    "format": "markdown",
    "text": "# Glossary of harbour terms\n\nBollard\n\nA short post on a quay used for mooring ships.\n\nFender\n\nA cushion that protects a hull from the quay wall.\n\nSlipway\n\nA ramp that lets boats move between land and water."
